  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\nThis page lists all MediaWiki pages used on this wiki. Proceed with caution when editing these.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Site homepage</b></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AMainpage\" title=\"MediaWiki:Mainpage\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Homepage</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Community pages</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AWelcome-user-page\" title=\"MediaWiki:Welcome-user-page\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Welcome profile message</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AWelcome-message-wall-user\" title=\"MediaWiki:Welcome-message-wall-user\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Welcome wall message</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AWelcome-user\" title=\"MediaWiki:Welcome-user\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Welcome message setting</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"MediaWiki:Welcome-enabled (page does not exist)\">Welcome message setting</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AWelcome-bot-flag\" title=\"MediaWiki:Welcome-bot-flag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Show/hide welcome messages in Recent Changes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3ACommunity\" title=\"Special:Community\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Special:Community</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3ACommunity-corner\" title=\"MediaWiki:Community-corner\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Community box</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3ACommunity-to-do-list\" title=\"MediaWiki:Community-to-do-list\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Community to-do</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3ACommunitypage-admin-welcome-message\" title=\"MediaWiki:Communitypage-admin-welcome-message\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Community welcome message</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3ACommunitypage-policy-module-link-page-name\" title=\"MediaWiki:Communitypage-policy-module-link-page-name\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Community policy link</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"MediaWiki:User-identity-box-group-bureaucrat (page does not exist)\">Bureaucrat label</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AUser-identity-box-group-sysop\" title=\"MediaWiki:User-identity-box-group-sysop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sysop label</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AUser-identity-box-group-content-moderator\" title=\"MediaWiki:User-identity-box-group-content-moderator\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Content Moderator label</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Site messages</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AProtect-dropdown\" title=\"MediaWiki:Protect-dropdown\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Protect menu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3ADeletereason-dropdown\" title=\"MediaWiki:Deletereason-dropdown\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Delete page menu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AFiledelete-reason-dropdown\" title=\"MediaWiki:Filedelete-reason-dropdown\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Delete file menu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AIpbreason-dropdown\" title=\"MediaWiki:Ipbreason-dropdown\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Block menu reasons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AIpboptions\" title=\"MediaWiki:Ipboptions\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Block menu options</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3ALicenses\" title=\"MediaWiki:Licenses\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">License menu</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>CSS</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>All skins: <a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3ACommon.css\" title=\"MediaWiki:Common.css\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Common</a></li>\n<li>Oasis only: <span class=\"new\" title=\"MediaWiki:Wikia.css (page does not exist)\">Wikia</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>JavaScript</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AWikia.js\" title=\"MediaWiki:Wikia.js\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wikia</a> (requires review)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3ACommon.js\" title=\"MediaWiki:Common.js\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Common</a> (requires review)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=MediaWiki%3AImportJS\" title=\"MediaWiki:ImportJS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ImportJS</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>References</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Welcome_tool\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Help:Welcome tool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Welcome Tool</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dev.fandom.com/wiki/Fandom_Open_Source_Library\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dev:Fandom Open Source Library\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Open Source Library</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030017\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expan